{"id":"eefd035b-153f-48f5-98f9-3e602cb929c0","createdAt":"2026-10-26T14:46:47.260Z","batchId":"settings_claude-haiku-5-5_medium","approach":"html","modelId":"claude-haiku-5-5","settings":{"effort":"medium"},"presetId":"settings","prompt":"An account settings panel with profile, notifications and privacy sections.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page\">\n  <header class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n    <h1>Account settings</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead\">Manage your profile, how we contact you, and who can see your activity.</p>\n    <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n      <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Plan: Pro</span>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Last updated 2 days ago</span>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <div class=\"stack gap-lg\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n\n    <section class=\"card stack gap-lg\" id=\"profile\">\n      <div>\n        <h2 class=\"card-title\">Profile</h2>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">This information appears on your public profile and in shared projects.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row gap-lg center\">\n        <div class=\"avatar\">AK</div>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n            <button class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm\" type=\"button\">Upload photo</button>\n            <button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" type=\"button\">Remove</button>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"small muted\">JPG or PNG, at least 256×256 px, up to 5 MB.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"grid cols-2\">\n        <label>Full name\n          <input type=\"text\" value=\"Amara Kingsley\" data-track>\n        </label>\n        <label>Display name\n          <input type=\"text\" value=\"Amara K.\" data-track>\n        </label>\n        <label>Email address\n          <input type=\"email\" value=\"amara.kingsley@example.com\" data-track>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">Verified on 14 March 2024</span>\n        </label>\n        <label>Time zone\n          <select data-track>\n            <option>(UTC+00:00) London</option>\n            <option selected>(UTC+01:00) Lagos</option>\n            <option>(UTC+01:00) Berlin</option>\n            <option>(UTC-05:00) New York</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n      </div>\n\n      <label>Bio\n        <textarea rows=\"3\" maxlength=\"160\" data-track id=\"bio\">Product designer working on accessibility tooling. Usually found sketching in the margins.</textarea>\n        <span class=\"small muted\"><span id=\"bio-count\">86</span> / 160 characters</span>\n      </label>\n\n      <div class=\"row between center\">\n        <span class=\"small muted\" id=\"profile-status\">All changes saved</span>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n          <button class=\"btn btn-ghost\" type=\"button\">Discard</button>\n          <button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\" data-save=\"profile\">Save profile</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"card stack gap-lg\" id=\"notifications\">\n      <div>\n        <h2 class=\"card-title\">Notifications</h2>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">Choose which updates you receive and where they are delivered.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\">\n        <table class=\"table\">\n          <thead>\n            <tr>\n              <th>Activity</th>\n              <th>Email</th>\n              <th>In app</th>\n              <th>Push</th>\n            </tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr>\n              <td>\n                <div class=\"stack\">\n                  <strong>Mentions and replies</strong>\n                  <span class=\"small muted\">When someone @mentions you or replies to your comment</span>\n                </div>\n              </td>\n              <td><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> <span class=\"sr-only\">Email</span></label></td>\n              <td><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> <span class=\"sr-only\">In app</span></label></td>\n              <td><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> <span class=\"sr-only\">Push</span></label></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>\n                <div class=\"stack\">\n                  <strong>Task assignments</strong>\n                  <span class=\"small muted\">When a task is assigned to you or its due date changes</span>\n                </div>\n              </td>\n              <td><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> <span class=\"sr-only\">Email</span></label></td>\n              <td><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> <span class=\"sr-only\">In app</span></label></td>\n              <td><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> <span class=\"sr-only\">Push</span></label></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>\n                <div class=\"stack\">\n                  <strong>Weekly summary</strong>\n                  <span class=\"small muted\">A digest of your open tasks and team activity every Monday</span>\n                </div>\n              </td>\n              <td><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> <span class=\"sr-only\">Email</span></label></td>\n              <td><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> <span class=\"sr-only\">In app</span></label></td>\n              <td><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> <span class=\"sr-only\">Push</span></label></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>\n                <div class=\"stack\">\n                  <strong>Security alerts</strong>\n                  <span class=\"small muted\">Sign-ins from new devices and password changes</span>\n                </div>\n              </td>\n              <td><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked disabled> <span class=\"sr-only\">Email</span></label></td>\n              <td><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked disabled> <span class=\"sr-only\">In app</span></label></td>\n              <td><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> <span class=\"sr-only\">Push</span></label></td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"small muted\">Security alerts for email and in-app cannot be turned off.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"grid cols-2\">\n        <label>Quiet hours start\n          <select data-track>\n            <option selected>20:00</option>\n            <option>21:00</option>\n            <option>22:00</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n        <label>Quiet hours end\n          <select data-track>\n            <option>07:00</option>\n            <option selected>08:00</option>\n            <option>09:00</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n      </div>\n      <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Pause push notifications during quiet hours</label>\n\n      <div class=\"row between center\">\n        <span class=\"small muted\">2 channels changed since last save</span>\n        <button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\" data-save=\"notifications\">Save preferences</button>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"card stack gap-lg\" id=\"privacy\">\n      <div>\n        <h2 class=\"card-title\">Privacy</h2>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">Control who can see your profile and activity, and how your data is used.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <strong>Profile visibility</strong>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"visibility\" checked> Everyone in my organisation</label>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"visibility\"> Only people I collaborate with</label>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"visibility\"> Only me</label>\n      </div>\n\n      <hr>\n\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <strong>Activity</strong>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Show when I am online</label>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Show my recently viewed projects to teammates</label>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> Show my time zone on my profile</label>\n      </div>\n\n      <hr>\n\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <strong>Data</strong>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Use my activity to improve search suggestions</label>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> Share anonymised usage data with product research</label>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n          <button class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm\" type=\"button\">Download my data</button>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">Export is emailed as a ZIP and expires after 7 days.</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row between center\">\n        <span class=\"small muted\">Changes apply immediately to new activity.</span>\n        <button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\" data-save=\"privacy\">Save privacy settings</button>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"card stack gap-lg\" id=\"danger\">\n      <div>\n        <h2 class=\"card-title\">Delete account</h2>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">Deleting your account removes your profile and personal data after a 30-day recovery window.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"alert alert-destructive\">\n        <strong>This cannot be undone after 30 days.</strong>\n        Your 4 owned projects will be transferred to Northwind Studio before deletion.\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row between center\">\n        <span class=\"small muted\">You can cancel within the recovery window by signing in.</span>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-destructive\" type=\"button\">Delete account</button>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var status = document.getElementById('profile-status');\n  var bio = document.getElementById('bio');\n  var count = document.getElementById('bio-count');\n\n  if (bio && count) {\n    bio.addEventListener('input', function () {\n      count.textContent = bio.value.length;\n    });\n  }\n\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-track]').forEach(function (el) {\n    el.addEventListener('input', markDirty);\n    el.addEventListener('change', markDirty);\n  });\n\n  function markDirty() {\n    if (status) {\n      status.textContent = 'You have unsaved changes';\n      status.classList.add('down');\n    }\n  }\n\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-save]').forEach(function (btn) {\n    btn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n      var section = btn.getAttribute('data-save');\n      btn.textContent = 'Saved';\n      setTimeout(function () { btn.textContent = section === 'profile' ? 'Save profile' : (section === 'notifications' ? 'Save preferences' : 'Save privacy settings'); }, 1500);\n      if (section === 'profile' && status) {\n        status.textContent = 'All changes saved';\n        status.classList.remove('down');\n      }\n    });\n  });\n})();\n</script>","deltas":[[4557,"<div class=\""],[4557,"page\">\n  <header"],[4557," class=\"st"],[4557,"ack g"],[4557,"ap-sm\">\n    <"],[4557,"h1>Account sett"],[4557,"ings</h1>\n    <"],[4557,"p class=\"lead\">Man"],[4557,"age your profile, how"],[4557," we cont"],[4557,"act you, and who"],[4557," can see your activ"],[4557,"ity.</p>\n    <"],[4557,"div class=\"row g"],[4557,"ap-sm\">\n      <"],[4557,"span"],[4565," class=\"badge badge-sec"],[4565,"ondary\">Pl"],[4565,"an: P"],[4